docs {
  DRY RUN. Shows exactly which keys a purge would delete, and changes nothing.

  Response includes:
    tag          the entity tag, e.g. Account.acct-1001
    responseIds  every cached operation containing that account
    keys         every Redis key that would be deleted

  Run this before the DELETE in a demo. It makes the blast radius visible
  before anything is destroyed.
}
